    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/3f85eb5300f24cf695c53f198fe3a968.poster.avif?t=1753370444\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/3f85eb5300f24cf695c53f198fe3a968.webp?t=1753370444\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/f6808537e29877029300b6957342931e.poster.avif?t=1753370444\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/f6808537e29877029300b6957342931e.webm?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/f6808537e29877029300b6957342931e.mp4?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/912cdd7691c43945c99205f35868ac57.poster.avif?t=1753370444\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/912cdd7691c43945c99205f35868ac57.webm?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/912cdd7691c43945c99205f35868ac57.mp4?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Classic-Inspired Journey, Reimagined in a Modern Metroidvania World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the role of Hira, a mysterious child fated to stand against ancient gods. Fallen Tear: The Ascension combines the emotional weight and party-building of classic JRPGs with the freeform exploration of Metroidvanias and just a sprinkle of roguelike challenge. Every death teaches. Every bond matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Love Letter to JRPGs\u2014Told Through a Hand-Drawn Metroidvania</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a Massive, Interconnected World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Venture through lush forests, lost cities, and forgotten ruins\u2014all hand-crafted and filled with secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/995316fd0adee57294d109307e05366c.poster.avif?t=1753370444\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/995316fd0adee57294d109307e05366c.webm?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/995316fd0adee57294d109307e05366c.mp4?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master Tactical, Reactive Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Precise dodges. Parry timing. Weapon-swapping. Switch strategies mid-fight using your allies' Fated Bond skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/2f5c574194b320e2c9e12bc4eb99d839.poster.avif?t=1753370444\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/2f5c574194b320e2c9e12bc4eb99d839.webm?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/2f5c574194b320e2c9e12bc4eb99d839.mp4?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Recruit and Bond with Party Members</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 16 voiced characters inspired by classic RPG archetypes\u2014mages, swordsmen, tricksters, healers. Form bonds, unlock combo skills, and evolve your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roguelike Influence with Persistent Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Every run teaches you something new\u2014map paths, enemy patterns, and hidden mechanics. But the story, character progress, and upgrades carry forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/720af82bacf9547e1a1abc48784d9c35.poster.avif?t=1753370444\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/720af82bacf9547e1a1abc48784d9c35.webm?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/720af82bacf9547e1a1abc48784d9c35.mp4?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize Your Castle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Your Castle is more than a safe zone\u2014it\u2019s a visual reflection of your choices and relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hand-Animated 2D Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Gorgeously drawn sprites and environments, inspired by JRPGs of the golden era, reimagined with modern indie flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you ever wished Final Fantasy met Hollow Knight in a hand-painted world, this is your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/3f85eb5300f24cf695c53f198fe3a968.poster.avif?t=1753370444\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/3f85eb5300f24cf695c53f198fe3a968.webp?t=1753370444\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/f6808537e29877029300b6957342931e.poster.avif?t=1753370444\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/f6808537e29877029300b6957342931e.webm?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/f6808537e29877029300b6957342931e.mp4?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/912cdd7691c43945c99205f35868ac57.poster.avif?t=1753370444\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/912cdd7691c43945c99205f35868ac57.webm?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/912cdd7691c43945c99205f35868ac57.mp4?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Classic-Inspired Journey, Reimagined in a Modern Metroidvania World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the role of Hira, a mysterious child fated to stand against ancient gods. Fallen Tear: The Ascension combines the emotional weight and party-building of classic JRPGs with the freeform exploration of Metroidvanias and just a sprinkle of roguelike challenge. Every death teaches. Every bond matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Love Letter to JRPGs\u2014Told Through a Hand-Drawn Metroidvania</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a Massive, Interconnected World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Venture through lush forests, lost cities, and forgotten ruins\u2014all hand-crafted and filled with secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/995316fd0adee57294d109307e05366c.poster.avif?t=1753370444\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/995316fd0adee57294d109307e05366c.webm?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/995316fd0adee57294d109307e05366c.mp4?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master Tactical, Reactive Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Precise dodges. Parry timing. Weapon-swapping. Switch strategies mid-fight using your allies' Fated Bond skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/2f5c574194b320e2c9e12bc4eb99d839.poster.avif?t=1753370444\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/2f5c574194b320e2c9e12bc4eb99d839.webm?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/2f5c574194b320e2c9e12bc4eb99d839.mp4?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Recruit and Bond with Party Members</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 16 voiced characters inspired by classic RPG archetypes\u2014mages, swordsmen, tricksters, healers. Form bonds, unlock combo skills, and evolve your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roguelike Influence with Persistent Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Every run teaches you something new\u2014map paths, enemy patterns, and hidden mechanics. But the story, character progress, and upgrades carry forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/720af82bacf9547e1a1abc48784d9c35.poster.avif?t=1753370444\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/720af82bacf9547e1a1abc48784d9c35.webm?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/720af82bacf9547e1a1abc48784d9c35.mp4?t=1753370444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize Your Castle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Your Castle is more than a safe zone\u2014it\u2019s a visual reflection of your choices and relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hand-Animated 2D Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Gorgeously drawn sprites and environments, inspired by JRPGs of the golden era, reimagined with modern indie flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you ever wished Final Fantasy met Hollow Knight in a hand-painted world, this is your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
